While Wang Lin is reaching Late stage Ascendant, we got a chapter in the novel about what's happening in the Alliance Star System. The information below will probably be adapted later.

Zi Xin (the woman who absorbed Qian Feng's cultivation) became a concubine of the Blood Ancestor. She investigates an abandonned planet where the Ancient God original body was cultivating. The original body had absorbed the whole planet's energy so it collapses entirely. However, its cultivation is stuck and not able to reach 4-stars without the aura of an adult Ancient God.

On planet Suzaku, deep in the Sea of Devils, in the Land of the Ancient God, Tuo Sens is still plotting.
“Wang Lin, I’m about to be free…”
A person with a monkey on its shoulder walks out of the Chaotic Broken Stars. That person is the Sky Devil Magician, the master of the Six Desires Devil Lord.
“The realm under the Thunder Celestial Realm…” Sky Devil Magician’s body flickered and left planet Suzaku.

On Mount Suzaku, Zhou Ru had just reached Nascent Soul. She's now able to open the bag of holding Wang Lin gave Tie Yan before he left. Inside that bag, there was nothing but a white light that entered her head. Her memories of what happened that Wang Lin had sealed flash before her eyes.
Tears appeared on Zhou Ru’s face, and after a long time, she lowered her head, sat down, and hugged her knees. She couldn’t stop her tears.
“Little White, it turns out Uncle never wanted me to find him…”

